{"version":1,"content":"<p>第十六屆中國國際航空航天博覽會（俗稱「珠海航展」）今（16日）在珠海舉行門票銷售發布會，宣布本屆航展主展區珠海國際航展中心個人票價格為600元（人民幣，下同），較2016年起維持的每人500元上調20%，為10年來首次加價。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:40:33.343831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:20:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:17:44.577648+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:38:00.856038+00:00","content_hash":"4ed90bbfd94041fef6e297ee12c470dac7c8fab8cc3fc6221826b434eed1d0e2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}